    "tagLine": "Feel at home in this  well-connected  North Dublin coastal suburb",
    "location": "The Brickworks, Station Manor is located in the picturesque village of Portmarnock. You have all the convenience of great transport links to the city center and beyond, easy access to the M50 and Dublin Airport. Portmarnock Village is a short stroll away which provides for your every need with an excellent choice of retail and services. Numerous grocery stores, coffee shops, restaurants can all be enjoyed in this desireable neighborhood. The Stunning beaches in Portmarnock open up a wide variety of leisure activities and the famous silver strand beach offers views of Ireland's Eye, Howth Head, and Lambay Island. \r\n\r\nOnly a short distance away are the neighboring villages of Malahide and Howth with an abundance of additional amenities and services."
